-- Worked examples for doc/tutorials/getting-started/grouping-and-precedence.md
--
-- Every snippet quoted in that tutorial lives here, so the page cannot drift
-- from code that compiles. The ladder figures beside it are generated from
-- THIS file through the LSP -- see ts-shared/ladder-svg/demo/grouping.ts.

§ `Grouping and precedence`

-- The same three atoms, grouped two ways by indentation alone.

GIVEN `a` IS A BOOLEAN
      `b` IS A BOOLEAN
      `c` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `left grouped` IF
            `a`
        OR  `b`
    AND `c`

GIVEN `a` IS A BOOLEAN
      `b` IS A BOOLEAN
      `c` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `right grouped` IF
        `a`
    OR      `b`
        AND `c`

-- On one line, with no layout signal, the precedence table decides.
GIVEN `a` IS A BOOLEAN
      `b` IS A BOOLEAN
      `c` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `one line` IF `a` OR `b` AND `c`

#EVAL `left grouped`  TRUE FALSE FALSE   -- FALSE
#EVAL `right grouped` TRUE FALSE FALSE   -- TRUE
#EVAL `one line`      TRUE FALSE FALSE   -- TRUE: a OR (b AND c)

§ `Chew — bracketing`

GIVEN `makes improper use of his position` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an advantage for himself`           IS A BOOLEAN
      `an advantage for any other person`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `detriment to the corporation`       IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `contravenes s 229(4)` IF
        "An officer or employee of a corporation shall not"
    ... `makes improper use of his position`
    ... "as such an officer or employee,"
    AND     "to gain, directly or indirectly, an advantage"
        ..  `an advantage for himself`
        ..  `an advantage for any other person`
        ..  "or to cause"
        OR  `detriment to the corporation`

#EVAL `contravenes s 229(4)` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE    -- TRUE
#EVAL `contravenes s 229(4)` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE   -- FALSE

§ `Oakhurst — tokenization`

GIVEN `packs the goods` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `exempt — packing is one activity` IF
        "packing for shipment or distribution"
    ... `packs the goods`

GIVEN `packs the goods for shipment` IS A BOOLEAN
      `distributes the goods`        IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `exempt — packing and distribution are two` IF
        "packing for shipment"   ... `packs the goods for shipment`
    OR  "or distribution"        ... `distributes the goods`

-- A driver who distributes but does not pack: exempt on one reading only.
#EVAL `exempt — packing is one activity`          FALSE         -- FALSE
#EVAL `exempt — packing and distribution are two` FALSE TRUE    -- TRUE

§ `Rogers — attachment`

GIVEN `initial term is running`        IS A BOOLEAN
      `a renewal term is running`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `one year notice has been given` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in force — notice binds renewals only` IF
            "for a period of five (5) years"      ... `initial term is running`
        OR      "and thereafter for successive terms"
                ... `a renewal term is running`
                AND NOT `one year notice has been given`

GIVEN `initial term is running`        IS A BOOLEAN
      `a renewal term is running`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `one year notice has been given` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in force — notice binds both` IF
            "for a period of five (5) years"      ... `initial term is running`
        OR  "and thereafter for successive terms" ... `a renewal term is running`
    AND NOT `one year notice has been given`

-- The dispute: initial term running, notice served.
#EVAL `in force — notice binds renewals only` TRUE FALSE TRUE   -- TRUE, still in force
#EVAL `in force — notice binds both`          TRUE FALSE TRUE   -- FALSE, terminated
